    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into 8 enormous stages brimming with challenges, rewards, enhancements, and formidable enemies as you assist Mitch in his quest to locate his missing canine companion. Death Trap Mountain presents a timeless adventure in platforming, incorporating numerous novel concepts. The terrain presents increasingly challenging scenarios for Mitch to navigate. Mitch is likely to encounter numerous adversaries and forge a few allies in his journey! A sinister threat looms over the realm as the black dragon Illugir awaits in his domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bellow are some zoomed out images of the first 3 levels. (Work in Progress)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/extras/bf77966d0ded029950d2ad03b46b7100.avif?t=1755573123\" data-has-big width=800 height=524 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/extras/f9db617a350e3c59a5f2fc19adde86a9.avif?t=1755573123\" data-has-big width=800 height=504 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/extras/daf578591cc5f4d7959b2cc0146bb5bc.avif?t=1755573123\" data-has-big width=800 height=504 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into 8 enormous stages brimming with challenges, rewards, enhancements, and formidable enemies as you assist Mitch in his quest to locate his missing canine companion. Death Trap Mountain presents a timeless adventure in platforming, incorporating numerous novel concepts. The terrain presents increasingly challenging scenarios for Mitch to navigate. Mitch is likely to encounter numerous adversaries and forge a few allies in his journey! A sinister threat looms over the realm as the black dragon Illugir awaits in his domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bellow are some zoomed out images of the first 3 levels. (Work in Progress)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/extras/bf77966d0ded029950d2ad03b46b7100.avif?t=1755573123\" data-has-big width=800 height=524 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/extras/f9db617a350e3c59a5f2fc19adde86a9.avif?t=1755573123\" data-has-big width=800 height=504 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294130/extras/daf578591cc5f4d7959b2cc0146bb5bc.avif?t=1755573123\" data-has-big width=800 height=504 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Mitch must battle his way into Illigur's Keep high in peaks of the Death Trap Mountains to rescue Gil, his beloved dog. He must transcend his working class roots into a hero that can subdue the evil legions of doom. A timeless 2D Platform Game filled with excitement, adventure, comedy and charm!",
